From c6872725fc64d9821b38c3becbba09206e3ac8aa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Krzako <krzako@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 00:28:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(llm-pi-ai): offer pi-ai session-affinity compat switches

pi-ai 0.84.2 already turns a request session id into affinity transport headers when the model compat opts in, but the completions gate withheld both switches, so no settings surface could enable them and the id the adapter forwards was dropped. No catalog entry or detection sets these fields - a private gateway must be told - so they belong with the offered surface. copilot-proxy reads x-session-id for its deepseek-harness source, and compaction/title requests carry the same id because every auxiliary call stamps agent.session.id.
